---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: "Schedule a commercial assessment with Northform RGM Advisory. Most engagements start with a short, no-cost conversation about what's happening in your numbers."
permalink: /contact/index.html
---

<section class="shell hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
  <h1 class="display" style="margin-top:26px; max-width:18ch;">Schedule an assessment.</h1>
  <p class="lede hero__lede">Most engagements begin with a short, no-cost conversation about what&rsquo;s happening in your numbers. If we don&rsquo;t think we can move them, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="contact-grid">

      <div>
        <form name="assessment" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company-website" action="/thanks/">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="assessment">
          <p class="visually-hidden">
            <label>Leave this field empty <input name="company-website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
          </p>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="company">Company</label>
              <input id="company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="role">Role</label>
              <input id="role" name="role" type="text" autocomplete="organization-title">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="phone">Phone <span class="opt">optional</span></label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="focus">Where&rsquo;s the pressure showing up?</label>
            <select id="focus" name="focus">
              <option value="Not sure yet">Not sure yet, that&rsquo;s fine</option>
              <option value="Pricing">Pricing and pack architecture</option>
              <option value="Trade investment">Trade investment and promotional ROI</option>
              <option value="Portfolio and mix">Portfolio and range mix</option>
              <option value="Trade terms">Customer terms and profitability</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="message">What&rsquo;s happening in your numbers?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" placeholder="A sentence or two is plenty. Where the margin pressure is showing up, and what you&rsquo;ve already tried."></textarea>
          </div>

          <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Send</button>
          <p class="form-note">We reply within one working day. Nothing you send is shared with anyone.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <aside class="contact-aside">
        <h2 class="h3">Or go direct</h2>
        <ul class="footer__list" style="margin-top:20px;">
          <li><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}" class="contact-direct">{{ site.phone }}</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="contact-direct">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
        </ul>

        <hr class="rule" style="margin:32px 0;">

        <h2 class="h3">What to expect</h2>
        <ol class="expect">
          <li><span>A 30-minute conversation about where margin pressure is showing up in your business.</span></li>
          <li><span>An honest read on whether there is something worth pursuing, and roughly what it might be worth.</span></li>
          <li><span>If it makes sense, a scoped proposal. If it doesn&rsquo;t, we&rsquo;ll tell you that instead.</span></li>
        </ol>

        <hr class="rule" style="margin:32px 0;">

        <p style="font-size:14.5px; color:var(--slate);">Northform works with New Zealand FMCG suppliers. If you are a retailer or sit outside grocery, get in touch anyway and we will tell you straight away whether we are the right fit.</p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
